<section class="hero">
  <svg class="hero-net" viewBox="0 0 560 420" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M90.0 300.0 Q124.7 297.4 142.5 267.5 Q160.3 237.6 195.0 235.0 Q229.7 232.4 247.5 202.5 Q265.3 172.6 300.0 170.0" fill="none" stroke="#C1694F" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.28" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M300.0 170.0 Q319.4 188.4 342.5 175.0 Q365.6 161.6 385.0 180.0 Q404.4 198.4 427.5 185.0 Q450.6 171.6 470.0 190.0" fill="none" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.32" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M300.0 170.0 Q278.8 193.0 286.7 223.3 Q294.6 253.6 273.3 276.7 Q252.1 299.7 260.0 330.0" fill="none" stroke="#8B9199" stroke-width="1.8" opacity="0.3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M470.0 190.0 Q437.8 205.8 426.7 240.0 Q415.6 274.2 383.3 290.0 Q351.1 305.8 340.0 340.0" fill="none" stroke="#C1694F" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.22" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M90.0 300.0 Q116.1 317.8 146.7 310.0 Q177.3 302.2 203.3 320.0 Q229.4 337.8 260.0 330.0" fill="none" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.26" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M300.0 170.0 Q287.2 145.9 260.0 143.3 Q232.8 140.8 220.0 116.7 Q207.2 92.5 180.0 90.0" fill="none" stroke="#8B9199" stroke-width="1.6" opacity="0.25" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="90" cy="300" r="16" fill="#C1694F" opacity="0.75"/>
    <circle cx="300" cy="170" r="20" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.8"/>
    <circle cx="470" cy="190" r="12" fill="#C1694F" opacity="0.55"/>
    <circle cx="260" cy="330" r="10" fill="#8B9199" opacity="0.6"/>
    <circle cx="340" cy="340" r="7" fill="#C9A84C" opacity="0.55"/>
    <circle cx="180" cy="90" r="9" fill="#8B9199" opacity="0.5"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h2>Consumer neurotech finally has a <span class="accent">home.</span></h2>
      <p class="lede">Headbands that track focus. Earbuds that sense sleep. Headphones that notice when you hit flow. The devices are here, and the people using them will shape what comes next. BrainsConnected is one friendly place to discover products, compare notes with other users, and help invent what these devices become.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="https://sharenarice.com/pages/brainsconnected-signup.html" class="btn-primary">Get the free newsletter</a>
        <a href="#founder" class="btn-ghost">Read our founder's welcome</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="trust-band">
    <svg width="42" height="42" viewBox="0 0 42 42" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <path d="M21 4 L35 10 V20 C35 29 29 35.5 21 38 C13 35.5 7 29 7 20 V10 Z" fill="#EDE1D0" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
