    <a href="#">Read the brain data privacy policy</a>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="discover">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h3>Latest Stories</h3>
    <div class="rule"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid">

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-art a"><svg width="70" height="46" viewBox="0 0 70 46" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0 34.0 Q22.2 37.5 27.3 28.0 Q32.4 18.5 42.7 22.0 Q52.9 25.5 58.0 16.0" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.75" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="34" r="7" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.85"/><circle cx="58" cy="16" r="5" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.7"/></svg></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h4>REMspace Brings Neurotech to Lucid Dreams</h4>
        <p>The San Francisco consumer neurotech firm introduced the LucidMe social media platform for sharing dream journals.</p>
        <a href="https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20241029197513/en/REMspace-Launches-LucidMe-the-First-Social-Media-Platform-for-Sharing-Dream-Journals" class="card-link">Read more</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-art b"><svg width="70" height="46" viewBox="0 0 70 46" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.0 14.0 Q18.8 23.0 28.0 18.7 Q37.2 14.4 42.0 23.3 Q46.8 32.3 56.0 28.0" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.75" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="6" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.85"/><circle cx="56" cy="28" r="7" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.7"/></svg></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h4>A. K. Pradeep Explains How Neurotech and AI Can Drive Branding</h4>
        <p>A neuromarketing pioneer describes how neurotech, combined with GenAI, can shape the future of ad campaigns.</p>
        <a href="https://advertisingweek.com/3-unexpected-ways-brand-innovation-can-take-advantage-of-neuroscience-and-genai/" class="card-link">Read more</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-art c"><svg width="70" height="46" viewBox="0 0 70 46" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.0 20.0 Q19.1 27.6 27.3 21.3 Q35.6 15.0 42.7 22.7 Q49.7 30.3 58.0 24.0" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.75" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="5" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.8"/><circle cx="58" cy="24" r="7" fill="#FFFFFF" opacity="0.75"/></svg></div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <h4>Enophone Co-Founder Describes EEG Headset Market Potential</h4>
        <p>Eno CEO and co-founder Roy Burstin demonstrated his company's EEG sensing headset at the 2024 Neurotech Leaders Forum.</p>
