      <h3>The killer app hasn't been found yet</h3>
      <p class="big">Every platform wave had one. VisiCalc sold the Apple II. Ride hailing sold the smartphone. Consumer neurotech is still waiting for the application that makes millions of people want a device of their own.</p>
      <p>Maybe it teaches you a new language in days. Maybe it records your dreams at night and plays them back in the morning. Maybe it's something no one has imagined yet. BrainsConnected exists so that application gets conceived, tested, and launched here, by the people in this community. Joining now means you get a say in what it becomes.</p>
